    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Welcome to the new Stoolball England website - rebuilt from the ground up to be more modern, faster and more reliable than our previous site. Most of the features you're familiar with are still here, and those that aren't will be returning over the next few months.]]></Value>
